WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:03.136 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, all right.
Party, yeah.

00:00:03.136 --> 00:00:05.038 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm actually not
a very good drinker.

00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:07.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, like when my friends
are always like,

00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:08.308 line:92%
"Drink it, chug it, slam it,"

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:12.078
I'm always like, "I can't,
it's a daiquiri, it will hurt."

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:12.879 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:16.316 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't want to swallow
the umbrella.

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:17.183 size:78% position:39% line:92%
I am not a manly man.

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:19.152 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know I look like
a quarterback,

00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:21.087 line:92%
but inside I'm all cheerleader.

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:23.490 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:26.159 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah.

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:28.428 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm actually a huge
people pleaser.

00:00:28.428 --> 00:00:29.195 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Whoa, shocker, right?

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:31.131 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, like,
even when I'm in an Uber,

00:00:31.131 --> 00:00:33.767 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm like,
"Hey, do you want me to drive?

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:35.835 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:38.471 align:start size:94% position:6%
Take a load off, pal."
You know?

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:42.342
I figured out what Uber drivers
do not like at all --

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:45.078 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
hugs goodbye.

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:47.313 align:start size:94% position:6%
But it's like,
if you didn't want one,

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:49.816 align:start size:94% position:6%
why did you take me
to the airport?

00:00:49.816 --> 00:00:51.418 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.418 --> 00:00:52.419 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'm from Wisconsin.

00:00:52.419 --> 00:00:55.188 line:92%
You don't know how I was raised.

00:00:55.188 --> 00:00:56.756 align:start size:94% position:6%
I definitely have that vibe
about me.

00:00:56.756 --> 00:00:58.258
Like, if I sat down next to you
on an airplane,

00:00:58.258 --> 00:01:01.361
you would be like, "Ugh, this
guy is going to want to talk."

00:01:01.361 --> 00:01:04.364 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:06.232 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And I do.

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:08.468 size:81% position:41% line:92%
I want to talk so bad.

00:01:08.468 --> 00:01:10.670 align:start size:94% position:6%
I choose the middle seat
on purpose

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:12.305 line:92%
just so I have more options.

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:14.741 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:18.278 --> 00:01:21.314
Yeah, I'm like,
"Hey, what are we talking about?

00:01:21.314 --> 00:01:24.350 size:84% position:42%
Oh, we're talking about
putting on headphones.

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:27.420 align:start size:94% position:6%
A lot of people have been
talking about that."

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:31.658
I don't know if you guys can
tell by my deep, tortured eyes,

00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:34.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I've been through
some stuff.

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:37.130 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:38.298 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I went through a breakup
last year,

00:01:38.298 --> 00:01:41.167
and I don't know if you've ever
been through one of those,

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:43.203 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
but oh, gosh, wow.

00:01:43.203 --> 00:01:45.038 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It is so fun.

00:01:45.038 --> 00:01:46.439 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because you get to play
a game called

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:48.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Am I going to cry in public
today?"

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:50.176 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:51.911 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was crying so hard one day
in public

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:55.281
that a crying baby looked at me
and stopped crying.

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:55.815 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.815 --> 00:01:58.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, "Dude,
how full is your diaper?"

00:01:58.651 --> 00:02:01.821 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:04.557 line:92%
But crying is such a weird thing

00:02:04.557 --> 00:02:05.692 align:start size:94% position:6%
because
when you're crying alone,

00:02:05.692 --> 00:02:07.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
you're like,
"Nothing is worse than this."

00:02:07.494 --> 00:02:08.761 align:start size:94% position:6%
But when you're crying
in public,

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:10.964 line:92%
you're like, "This is worse."

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:13.700 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:16.569 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was in an airport
going through this breakup.

00:02:16.569 --> 00:02:17.303 size:84% position:42% line:92%
I felt a cry coming on,

00:02:17.303 --> 00:02:19.606 align:start size:94% position:6%
so I convinced myself that if
I just ate a sandwich

00:02:19.606 --> 00:02:23.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
I would have enough energy
and calories from the sandwich

00:02:23.076 --> 00:02:25.278 size:81% position:41% line:92%
to suppress the tears.

00:02:25.278 --> 00:02:26.079 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That's not a thing.

00:02:26.079 --> 00:02:28.047 size:88% position:44%
I'm pulling the sandwich
up to my face, I'm like,

00:02:28.047 --> 00:02:29.849 align:start size:94% position:6%
"If you just eat this,
you won't cry."

00:02:29.849 --> 00:02:32.185 align:start size:94% position:6%
And at that moment,
a businessman in a hurry

00:02:32.185 --> 00:02:34.687 align:start size:94% position:6%
smacks into me
and my sandwich goes "thwp!"

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:37.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
and one sad olive
was rolling away.

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:40.226 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like,
"Everyone's leaving me."

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:45.732 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:45.732 --> 00:02:48.801
And then I just started bawling
over my sandwich.

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:50.670 align:start size:94% position:6%
But it didn't sound like
regular crying.

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:52.639 align:start size:94% position:6%
Have you guys ever been
to the point

00:02:52.639 --> 00:02:53.706 line:92%
of the pathetic hyperventilation

00:02:53.706 --> 00:02:56.309 align:start size:94% position:6%
where your crying sounds
like pulling a straw

00:02:56.309 --> 00:02:58.978 align:start size:94% position:6%
in and out of
a fast-food-cup lid?

00:02:58.978 --> 00:03:00.313 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.313 --> 00:03:01.247 size:81% position:41% line:92%
That's where I was at.

00:03:01.247 --> 00:03:04.717
I was like, "I -- just --
want -- my -- sandwich!"

00:03:04.717 --> 00:03:07.120 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:12.258 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I -- want -- to eat --
right -- now."

00:03:12.258 --> 00:03:14.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the most amazing thing
happened --

00:03:14.494 --> 00:03:15.228 size:81% position:41% line:92%
instead of judging me,

00:03:15.228 --> 00:03:17.430
the businessman just panicked
and he started giving me money.

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:20.600
He's like, "Oh, no, there's a
one, there's a 5, that's a 20.

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:23.536
Why isn't this working?
It works on my children."

00:03:23.536 --> 00:03:25.505 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:25.505 --> 00:03:29.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
He gave me $38
on a $7 sandwich.

00:03:29.776 --> 00:03:31.578 align:start size:94% position:6%
And when he walked away,
I had an epiphany.

00:03:31.578 --> 00:03:35.315
I was like, "Oh, my gosh,
I just mugged a man...

00:03:35.315 --> 00:03:36.883 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
with my feelings.

00:03:36.883 --> 00:03:39.586 size:81% position:41%
That's not a weakness.
That's a super power."

00:03:39.586 --> 00:03:41.521 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:41.521 --> 00:03:43.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
But this story has
a happy ending

00:03:43.056 --> 00:03:45.091 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I just started dating
a new girl

00:03:45.091 --> 00:03:47.927
and I'm totally falling in love,
you know.

00:03:47.927 --> 00:03:49.162 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:49.162 --> 00:03:50.997 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, oh, thank you.
Yeah.

00:03:50.997 --> 00:03:52.665 line:92%
Yeah, we met on an airplane.

00:03:52.665 --> 00:03:56.302
I was like, "Yeah, middle seat's
working out.

00:03:56.302 --> 00:04:00.039 line:92%
Oh, your headphones are broken."

00:04:00.039 --> 00:04:03.576 size:78% position:39%
We got off the plane,
and she texted me.

00:04:03.576 --> 00:04:04.310 line:92%
She's way cooler than me.

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:07.647
She texted me, "HMU," which I
now know means, "hit me up."

00:04:07.647 --> 00:04:08.915 align:start size:94% position:6%
Right?
I didn't know that.

00:04:08.915 --> 00:04:11.284
I thought she was just spelling
out the sound it makes

00:04:11.284 --> 00:04:13.319 line:92%
when you send a text message.

00:04:13.319 --> 00:04:16.723 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:16.723 --> 00:04:20.994 align:start size:94% position:6%
I literally thought she wrote,
"hmu!"

00:04:20.994 --> 00:04:22.929 size:81% position:41% line:92%
So I replied, "eahph!"

00:04:22.929 --> 00:04:25.265 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:30.136 --> 00:04:32.905 size:78% position:39% line:92%
She wrote, "No, HMU!"

00:04:32.905 --> 00:04:35.642 size:81% position:41% line:92%
I wrote, "Yes, eahph."

00:04:35.642 --> 00:04:37.810 align:start size:94% position:6%
Finally she called me.
She goes, "What do you mean?"

00:04:37.810 --> 00:04:39.712 line:92%
I was like, "What do you mean?"

00:04:39.712 --> 00:04:41.714
She goes, "Mine means hit me up.
What does yours mean?"

00:04:41.714 --> 00:04:45.218 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I go, "Oh, my means E
and then eamph!"

00:04:45.218 --> 00:04:46.686 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:46.686 --> 00:04:48.955 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I swear to you,
the first time I kissed her,

00:04:48.955 --> 00:04:50.390 line:92%
I leaned in and I go, "eamph."

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:51.457 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:51.457 --> 00:04:53.326 size:75% position:38% line:92%
And she goes, "hmu!"

00:04:53.326 --> 00:04:56.529
And I was like, "I'm going
to marry her, you know?"

00:04:56.529 --> 00:05:01.067 align:start size:94% position:6%
She's way kinkier than me
because everybody is.

00:05:01.067 --> 00:05:05.538
She goes, "What are you into?
You know, like in the bedroom?"

00:05:05.538 --> 00:05:07.640 line:92%
And I was like, "Consent."

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:08.908 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:08.908 --> 00:05:11.878
All right, I'm Pete Lee. Thanks,
you've been a great crowd.

00:05:11.878 --> 00:05:12.645 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Thank you very much.

00:05:12.645 --> 00:05:15.982 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:15.982 --> 00:05:18.251 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:05:18.251 --> 00:05:21.788 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Pete Lee! Wow!

00:05:21.788 --> 00:05:23.890 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's how you do it
right there.

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:24.657 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Pete Lee.

00:05:24.657 --> 00:05:27.560 line:92%
